---
// Minimal Version Selection (MVS) dependency resolution vs SAT solver lockfiles, plus go.sum verification.
const W = 900;
const H = 312;
---
<figure class="gfmvs">
  <div class="gfmvs-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison between Minimal Version Selection (MVS) picking the highest declared minimum version max(v1.2, v1.4) deterministically versus SAT solver lockfiles, plus go.sum SHA-256 verification.">
      {/* Left panel: MVS Diamond Graph */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="446" height="284" rx="10" class="gfmvs-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gfmvs-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Minimal Version Selection (MVS) on diamond DAG</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Thuật toán chọn phiên bản tối thiểu (MVS)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="150" y="60" width="174" height="38" rx="6" class="gfmvs-box" />
      <text x="237" y="83" text-anchor="middle" class="gfmvs-b">your-service (go.mod)</text>

      <line x1="196" y1="98" x2="122" y2="126" class="gfmvs-edge" />
      <line x1="278" y1="98" x2="352" y2="126" class="gfmvs-edge" />

      <rect x="34" y="128" width="176" height="44" rx="6" class="gfmvs-box" />
      <text x="122" y="147" text-anchor="middle" class="gfmvs-b">auth-sdk v1.1</text>
      <text x="122" y="164" text-anchor="middle" class="gfmvs-m">requires core &ge; v1.2.0</text>

      <rect x="264" y="128" width="176" height="44" rx="6" class="gfmvs-box" />
      <text x="352" y="147" text-anchor="middle" class="gfmvs-b">metrics-sdk v1.0</text>
      <text x="352" y="164" text-anchor="middle" class="gfmvs-m">requires core &ge; v1.4.0</text>

      <line x1="122" y1="172" x2="210" y2="204" class="gfmvs-edge" />
      <line x1="352" y1="172" x2="264" y2="204" class="gfmvs-edge" />

      <rect x="74" y="206" width="326" height="76" rx="6" class="gfmvs-box is-ok" />
      <text x="237" y="227" text-anchor="middle" class="gfmvs-b-ok">MVS picks: core v1.4.0 = max(v1.2.0, v1.4.0)</text>
      <text x="237" y="246" text-anchor="middle" class="gfmvs-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Never jumps to untested v1.9.0 just because it exists!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không tự nhảy lên v1.9.0 mới nhất nếu không ai khai báo.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="237" y="264" text-anchor="middle" class="gfmvs-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Same go.mod = identical build graph years later.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng 1 file go.mod → build 3 năm sau vẫn ra đúng v1.4.0.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: Major /v2 SIV + go.sum hash verification */}
      <rect x="478" y="14" width="408" height="284" rx="10" class="gfmvs-card" />
      <text x="494" y="42" class="gfmvs-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Semantic Import Versioning &amp; go.sum lock hashes</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. /v2 Semantic Import &amp; kiểm tra hash go.sum</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="494" y="60" width="376" height="68" rx="6" class="gfmvs-box" />
      <text x="508" y="80" class="gfmvs-b">v1: import "github.com/acme/kv"</text>
      <text x="508" y="99" class="gfmvs-b">v2: import "github.com/acme/kv/v2"</text>
      <text x="508" y="117" class="gfmvs-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Breaking v2 uses a distinct import path — zero conflicts.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bản v2 breaking mang đường dẫn riêng → sống chung được với v1.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="494" y="142" width="376" height="68" rx="6" class="gfmvs-box" />
      <text x="508" y="162" class="gfmvs-b">go.sum (SHA-256 checksums, not lockfile graph)</text>
      <text x="508" y="180" class="gfmvs-m">github.com/acme/core v1.4.0 h1:a9xQ...=</text>
      <text x="508" y="198" class="gfmvs-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Verifies ZIP bytes vs sum.golang.org transparency log.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đối chiếu mã băm file tải về chống giả mạo mã nguồn từ proxy.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="494" y="222" width="376" height="60" rx="6" class="gfmvs-box is-red" />
      <text x="508" y="242" class="gfmvs-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Contrast: NP-complete SAT solvers (npm/Cargo)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khác biệt: bộ giải SAT cần file lock phụ (npm/Cargo)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="508" y="261" class="gfmvs-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Range "^1.2" silently resolves to unpinned 1.9 on fresh CI.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khoảng "^1.2" tự kéo bản 1.9 mới nếu mất file lock ngoài CI.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>MVS always selects the oldest version satisfying every go.mod constraint (max of minimums), eliminating silent surprise upgrades while go.sum verifies downloaded bits cryptographically.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>MVS luôn chọn phiên bản thấp nhất thỏa mãn toàn bộ yêu cầu trong go.mod (max của các cận dưới), loại bỏ hoàn toàn cảnh tự nâng bản gây lỗi ngầm, còn go.sum chốt chặt mã băm SHA-256.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gfmvs { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gfmvs-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gfmvs svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 660px; height: auto; }
  .gfmvs text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gfmvs-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gfmvs-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gfmvs-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gfmvs-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfmvs-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfmvs-edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gfmvs-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfmvs-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfmvs-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gfmvs-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfmvs-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfmvs-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gfmvs figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
